        "en": "Enthusiastic and loving pet care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dogs visiting this Liberty Village facility show evident excitement, with owners describing pets eager to rush through the doors to play with friends. Reviewers highlight personalized attention for individual needs, such as soothing pumpkin treats for upset stomachs or paw balm applications. Clients also note positive socialization benefits for shy pups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly and attentive canine coaches"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the front desk staff and canine coaches for their welcoming greetings and genuine affection toward every dog. Reviewers appreciate that team members learn each pet by name and maintain a clean, closely supervised play environment. Clients also praise the patience and gentle handling demonstrated by the facility's spa groomers."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Live webcams and digital updates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the live webcam access that allows them to check on their dogs playing in themed rooms throughout the day. Reviewers also appreciate regular photo updates and report cards summarizing their pet's socialization and activities. These transparent communications provide considerable peace of mind during daycare and boarding stays."
      }
    }
